flowchart TD
    A[Authenticated GET / Range] --> B[Resolve bucket, key and version]
    B --> V{Valid byte range?}
    V -- No --> M[416 - Invalid range]
    V -- Yes / no range --> C[Load ordered chunk manifest]
    C --> D[Fetch R replicas or k RS shards]
    D --> E{Enough fragments with valid hashes?}
    E -- No --> X[503 - Data unavailable]
    E -- Yes --> F[Select replica / decode RS]
    F --> G[Verify logical chunk SHA-256]
    G --> H[Reassemble object on temp disk]
    H --> I{Range requested?}
    I -- No --> J[200 - Stream full object]
    I -- Yes --> L[206 - Stream byte range]
